Package: gr-m2k
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: GNU Radio blocks for ADALM2000
 gr-m2k is a GNU Radio out-of-tree module for interfacing with the
 ADALM2000, a portable lab for electronics learning and development.
 .
 This package contains the shared library and GRC block definitions.

